{
  "id": "dmwbdexigrmk5",
  "name": "范围滑块",
  "tags": [
    "表单",
    "拖拽"
  ],
  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "双端滑块选价格区间：两枚滑块各拖一端、靠近时自动钳制不交叉；拖动时滑块上方浮出当前值气泡，中间轨道填充实时跟随，←→ 可微调。",
  "usage": "电商 / 服务筛选里的价格、时长、距离区间选择；上下限明确、需要看清「选了哪一段」时，桌面与移动端都可用。",
  "caution": "取值非线性（价格档位差异极大）用分段档位按钮；单值选择改用单滑块；两端贴太近时移动端要加大间距或换成上下两个数字输入框。",
  "hint": "拖动两端滑块选价格区间，拖动时上方显示当前价格；←→ 可微调",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【范围滑块 Range Slider】目标：一个双端价格区间滑块（0–1000，选中 200–800，步长 10）。两枚圆形滑块各控制一端；拖动时被拖的那枚上方浮出当前值气泡、中间轨道填充实时跟随、顶部数值「¥200 – ¥800」同步更新；两端靠近时钳制不交叉；键盘 ←/→ 微调（Shift 加速 5 倍）、Home/End 到边界。\n\n1) 结构：.card（圆角 14、padding 14 16 13、底色 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg))、描边 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent)）里三行：.head（左标题 12px 600 + 右区间值 11.5px 600 tabular-nums）、.slider（position:relative、height 46、左右 margin 8、touch-action:none、user-select:none）、.ticks（三段刻度 0/500/1000，9.5px、var(--ui-text-dim)）。.slider 内：.track（absolute、left/right 0、top 50%、height 4、border-radius 2、background color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 13%,transparent)）；.fill（absolute、top 0 bottom 0、border-radius 2、background var(--ui-brand)，left/width 由 JS 按百分比写）；两枚 button.thumb（absolute、top 50%、20×20、margin -10 0 0 -10、border 2px solid var(--ui-brand)、border-radius 50%、background var(--ui-bg)、box-shadow 0 1px 4px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 28%,transparent)、cursor:grab）。\n\n2) 命中区：.thumb::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-11px}——视觉 20px，实际可点 42px；弹窗里放大到 26px 视觉 + inset:-11px（≈48px 命中）。\n\n3) 值气泡：每枚 thumb 里放 span.bubble（absolute、left 50%、bottom calc(100% + 9px)、translate(-50%,4px)、padding 2px 7px、border-radius 7px、background var(--ui-brand)、color var(--ui-bg)、font-size 10.5px、font-weight 600、opacity 0、pointer-events none、transition opacity .14s + transform .14s）；::after 画一个 4px 向下的三角（border-top-color:var(--ui-brand)）。只在 .thumb.dragging 时 `opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)`，所以平时不占视觉。\n\n4) 拖动（Pointer Events）：pointerdown 时 `e.preventDefault()`、给该 thumb 加 .dragging、`setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)`、`focus({preventScroll:true})`；pointermove 里用 `(clientX - slider.getBoundingClientRect().left) / 宽度` 换算成 0–1 比例再映射到 [MIN,MAX]、按 STEP 四舍五入；pointerup / pointercancel / lostpointercapture 三处收尾：移除 .dragging、releasePointerCapture、dragIdx 复位。拖动时 .thumb.dragging 放大到 scale(1.08) 并加一圈 brand 13% 的光环。不要用 CSS transition 追指针（跟手要靠每帧直接写值），只有松手后的视觉变化用过渡。\n\n5) 不交叉：滑块对里 lo/hi 是两个独立值，拖动左端时 `lo = min(新值, hi)`，拖动右端时 `hi = max(新值, lo)`；GAP 默认 0（允许贴在一起），需要留最小间距时把 GAP 设成一个步长的整数倍。\n\n6) 键盘与无障碍：两枚 thumb 都是 `<button type=\"button\" role=\"slider\">`，带 aria-label（最低价格 / 最高价格）、aria-valuemin=0、aria-valuemax=1000、aria-valuenow、aria-valuetext（如「200 元」）；←/→/↑/↓ 每次 ±STEP（Shift ×5），Home/End 到边界，全部 preventDefault；:focus-visible 用 4px brand 20% 光环。\n\n7) 坑：①拖动必须在 pointerdown 里 preventDefault + 容器 touch-action:none、user-select:none，否则移动端会滚页面、桌面会选中文字；②pointermove 只处理 `dragIdx === 当前 thumb` 的事件；③换算值必须用轨道 rect 而不是 window.innerWidth；④不用 scrollIntoView（会把外层页面一起滚），需要滚动就用容器 scrollTop 自己算；⑤浅色主题下轨道底色和滑块描边都要用 color-mix 叠 --ui-text，直接用 --ui-border 会看不见。\n\n8) 配色（宿主注入的 token 含义）：--ui-bg 画布、--ui-surface 卡片、--ui-surface-2 次级表面、--ui-border 分隔线、--ui-text 正文、--ui-text-dim 次要、--ui-brand 主色（轨道填充、滑块描边、气泡底）、气泡文字用 var(--ui-bg)（深色主题里 brand 是白色，写死 #fff 会白字白底消失）。\n\n9) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环；首轮延迟 0.3 秒；一轮 = 还原 200/800 → 光标移到左滑块（0.56 秒）→ press 后用 rAF 在 0.7 秒内把左端从 200 拖到 350（每帧调用 cursor.at 让光标跟着 thumb 中心）→ release → 0.32 秒后同样把右端从 800 拖到 620 → 0.26 秒后把光标移到右滑块 → 0.4 秒后 cursor.hide()、1.4 秒后复位；间隔 6.2 秒。自动演示里不要调 el.click()。\n\n10) 小视口（高度 ≤420）：卡片 padding 11 13 10、slider 高 40、thumb 18×18（margin -9）、气泡 9.5px、刻度 8.5px。放大弹窗（高度 ≥421）：卡片宽 min(540,100%)、padding 22 24 20、标题 17px、区间值 16px、slider 高 70、轨道 6px、thumb 26×26 边框 3px、气泡 13px、刻度 12px——确保 740×733 的弹窗里控件够大、能看清能拖。\n\n11) 使用场景：见 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px}\n\n.card{width:min(320px,100%);background:var(--ui-surface);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg));border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px 13px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;flex:0 0 auto}\n\n.head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex:0 0 auto}\n.head b{font-size:12px;font-weight:600}\n.head .val{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;transition:color .15s ease}\n\n.slider{position:relative;height:46px;flex:0 0 auto;margin:2px 8px 0;touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\n.track{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:50%;height:4px;margin-top:-2px;border-radius:2px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 13%,transparent)}\n.fill{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:0;width:0;border-radius:2px;background:var(--ui-brand)}\n\n.thumb{position:absolute;top:50%;left:0;width:20px;height:20px;padding:0;margin:-10px 0 0 -10px;border:2px solid var(--ui-brand);border-radius:50%;background:var(--ui-bg);box-shadow:0 1px 4px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 28%,transparent);cursor:grab;outline:none;transition:transform .12s ease,box-shadow .15s ease}\n.thumb::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-11px}\n.thumb:active{cursor:grabbing}\n.thumb:hover{box-shadow:0 0 0 6px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 10%,transparent),0 1px 4px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 28%,transparent)}\n.thumb:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 20%,transparent)}\n.thumb.dragging{transform:scale(1.08);cursor:grabbing;box-shadow:0 0 0 7px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 13%,transparent),0 2px 6px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 30%,transparent)}\n.thumb.pressing{transform:scale(.96)}\n\n.bubble{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:calc(100% + 9px);transform:translate(-50%,4px);padding:2px 7px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .14s ease,transform .14s ease}\n.bubble::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;width:0;height:0;margin-left:-4px;border:4px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--ui-brand)}\n.thumb.dragging .bubble{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n\n.ticks{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:0 8px;flex:0 0 auto}\n.ticks span{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:12px}\n  .card{padding:11px 13px 10px;gap:9px}\n  .head b{font-size:11px}\n  .head .val{font-size:10.5px}\n  .slider{height:40px;margin:1px 7px 0}\n  .thumb{width:18px;height:18px;margin:-9px 0 0 -9px}\n  .thumb::after{inset:-9px}\n  .bubble{font-size:9.5px;padding:1px 6px;bottom:calc(100% + 7px)}\n  .ticks span{font-size:8.5px}\n}\n\n/* 放大弹窗（740×733）：整体放大、命中区 ≥ 44px */\n@media (min-height:421px){\n  body{padding:40px}\n  .card{width:min(540px,100%);padding:22px 24px 20px;gap:18px;border-radius:18px}\n  .head b{font-size:17px}\n  .head .val{font-size:16px}\n  .slider{height:70px;margin:6px 12px 0}\n  .track{height:6px;margin-top:-3px;border-radius:3px}\n  .thumb{width:26px;height:26px;margin:-13px 0 0 -13px;border-width:3px}\n  .thumb::after{inset:-11px}\n  .bubble{font-size:13px;padding:3px 9px;bottom:calc(100% + 12px);border-radius:8px}\n  .bubble::after{border-width:5px;margin-left:-5px}\n  .ticks{margin:0 12px}\n  .ticks span{font-size:12px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .thumb,.bubble,.head .val{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><b>价格区间</b><span class=\"val\" id=\"valText\">¥200 – ¥800</span></div>\n  <div class=\"slider\" id=\"slider\">\n    <div class=\"track\">\n      <div class=\"fill\" id=\"fill\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"thumb\" id=\"thumbL\" type=\"button\" role=\"slider\" aria-label=\"最低价格\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"1000\" aria-valuenow=\"200\" aria-valuetext=\"200 元\">\n      <span class=\"bubble\" id=\"bubbleL\">¥200</span>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"thumb\" id=\"thumbR\" type=\"button\" role=\"slider\" aria-label=\"最高价格\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"1000\" aria-valuenow=\"800\" aria-valuetext=\"800 元\">\n      <span class=\"bubble\" id=\"bubbleR\">¥800</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ticks\"><span>¥0</span><span>¥500</span><span>¥1000</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var slider = document.getElementById('slider'),\n      fill = document.getElementById('fill'),\n      valText = document.getElementById('valText'),\n      thumbL = document.getElementById('thumbL'),\n      thumbR = document.getElementById('thumbR'),\n      bubbleL = document.getElementById('bubbleL'),\n      bubbleR = document.getElementById('bubbleR');\n\n  var MIN = 0, MAX = 1000, STEP = 10, GAP = 0;\n  var lo = 200, hi = 800;\n  var thumbs = [thumbL, thumbR];\n  var dragIdx = -1, activePointer = null;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null, rafId = 0;\n\n  function clamp(v){ return Math.max(MIN, Math.min(MAX, v)); }\n  function round(v){ return Math.round(v / STEP) * STEP; }\n  function pct(v){ return ((v - MIN) / (MAX - MIN)) * 100; }\n\n  function render(){\n    thumbL.style.left = pct(lo) + '%';\n    thumbR.style.left = pct(hi) + '%';\n    fill.style.left = pct(lo) + '%';\n    fill.style.width = (pct(hi) - pct(lo)) + '%';\n    bubbleL.textContent = '¥' + lo;\n    bubbleR.textContent = '¥' + hi;\n    valText.textContent = '¥' + lo + ' – ¥' + hi;\n    thumbL.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', lo);\n    thumbL.setAttribute('aria-valuetext', lo + ' 元');\n    thumbR.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', hi);\n    thumbR.setAttribute('aria-valuetext', hi + ' 元');\n  }\n\n  function setPair(nextLo, nextHi, from){\n    nextLo = clamp(round(nextLo));\n    nextHi = clamp(round(nextHi));\n    if(from === 0){\n      lo = Math.min(nextLo, nextHi - GAP);\n      hi = nextHi;\n    } else if(from === 1){\n      hi = Math.max(nextHi, nextLo + GAP);\n      lo = nextLo;\n    } else {\n      lo = nextLo; hi = nextHi;\n    }\n    render();\n  }\n\n  function valueFromX(clientX){\n    var r = slider.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var ratio = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (clientX - r.left) / r.width));\n    return MIN + ratio * (MAX - MIN);\n  }\n\n  function startDrag(i, e){\n    if(dragIdx !== -1) return;\n    dragIdx = i;\n    activePointer = e.pointerId;\n    var el = thumbs[i];\n    el.classList.add('dragging');\n    try { el.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); } catch(err){ /* 忽略 */ }\n    el.focus({ preventScroll: true });\n    if(e.clientX !== undefined) dragTo(i, e.clientX);\n  }\n\n  function dragTo(i, clientX){\n    var v = valueFromX(clientX);\n    if(i === 0) setPair(v, hi, 0);\n    else setPair(lo, v, 1);\n  }\n\n  function endDrag(){\n    if(dragIdx === -1) return;\n    var el = thumbs[dragIdx];\n    el.classList.remove('dragging');\n    if(activePointer !== null){\n      try { el.releasePointerCapture(activePointer); } catch(err){ /* 忽略 */ }\n    }\n    dragIdx = -1;\n    activePointer = null;\n  }\n\n  thumbs.forEach(function(el, i){\n    el.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(e){\n      e.preventDefault();\n      startDrag(i, e);\n    });\n    el.addEventListener('pointermove', function(e){\n      if(dragIdx !== i) return;\n      dragTo(i, e.clientX);\n    });\n    el.addEventListener('pointerup', endDrag);\n    el.addEventListener('pointercancel', endDrag);\n    el.addEventListener('lostpointercapture', endDrag);\n    el.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n      var step = (e.shiftKey ? STEP * 5 : STEP);\n      if(e.key === 'ArrowLeft' || e.key === 'ArrowDown'){\n        e.preventDefault();\n        if(i === 0) setPair(lo - step, hi, 0); else setPair(lo, hi - step, 1);\n      } else if(e.key === 'ArrowRight' || e.key === 'ArrowUp'){\n        e.preventDefault();\n        if(i === 0) setPair(lo + step, hi, 0); else setPair(lo, hi + step, 1);\n      } else if(e.key === 'Home'){\n        e.preventDefault();\n        if(i === 0) setPair(MIN, hi, 0); else setPair(lo, MIN, 1);\n      } else if(e.key === 'End'){\n        e.preventDefault();\n        if(i === 0) setPair(MAX, hi, 0); else setPair(lo, MAX, 1);\n      }\n    });\n  });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function thumbCenterX(i){\n    var r = thumbs[i].getBoundingClientRect();\n    return r.left + r.width / 2;\n  }\n  function thumbCenterY(i){\n    var r = thumbs[i].getBoundingClientRect();\n    return r.top + r.height / 2;\n  }\n\n  /* 用 rAF 一步一步把某个 thumb 从 from 拖到 to，光标同步跟着走 */\n  function dragThumb(c, i, from, to, dur, done){\n    var el = thumbs[i];\n    c.moveTo(el);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      el.classList.add('dragging');\n      dragIdx = i;\n      var t0 = performance.now();\n      function step(now){\n        var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / dur);\n        var eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);\n        var v = from + (to - from) * eased;\n        if(i === 0) setPair(v, hi, 0); else setPair(lo, v, 1);\n        var x = thumbCenterX(i), y = thumbCenterY(i);\n        c.at(x, y);\n        if(t < 1){ rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step); }\n        else {\n          el.classList.remove('dragging');\n          dragIdx = -1;\n          c.release();\n          done();\n        }\n      }\n      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    lo = 200; hi = 800; render();\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c){ setPair(350, 620, -1); return; }\n    if(c.el) c.el.classList.add('show');\n\n    dragThumb(c, 0, 200, 350, 700, function(){\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        dragThumb(c, 1, 800, 620, 700, function(){\n          setTimeout(function(){\n            c.moveTo(thumbR);\n            setTimeout(function(){\n              if(typeof c.hide === 'function') c.hide();\n              setTimeout(function(){ lo = 200; hi = 800; render(); }, 1400);\n            }, 400);\n          }, 260);\n        });\n      }, 320);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 6200); }, 300);\n  }\n\n  render();\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
